WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 6 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Lujain, do you remember Ammar from high school?

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:21.840
If he hadn't left her and moved to Los Angeles to become a surfer, she would never have settled for that miserable bum.

3
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.840
Ammar is in the past.

4
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.840
Yes, the love that was lost.

5
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.840
He was very handsome.

6
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.840
And strong.

7
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.840
Oh my God, I bet he could lift you up and spin you around.

8
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.840
He makes any girl melt with love.

9
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.840
If Ammar came back today and asked you to come back to him…

10
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.840
What would you say to him?

11
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:48.840
Well, I'm married, and I haven't seen Ammar in a long time.

12
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.840
Hello there, girl.

13
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.840
Lujain, we have to go.

14
00:00:53.840 --> 00:01:01.420
Are you keeping her away from her friends? Are you that jealous?

15
00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.420
I'm not ready to go.

16
00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.420
Did you forget?

17
00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.420
Forgot what?

18
00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.420
We have a dinner reservation to celebrate our wedding anniversary.

19
00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.420
The trade expo is on the same day as our wedding anniversary.

20
00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:17.120
So I booked for today.

21
00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.120
I can't.

22
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.120
Najwa hasn't seen me surf.

23
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.120
Don't worry about that.

24
00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.120
You'll be in Coco Maple's care.

25
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.120
And how would you know that?

26
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.120
Don't worry, my dear.

27
00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.300
Unbelievable, man.

28
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.300
Is that him?

29
00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.300
Just look at those abs.

30
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.300
Take a good look at his athletic body.

31
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:48.420
Ammar.

32
00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:51.060
Hello, my dear.

33
00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.060
I'm here to attend the expo.

34
00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.060
We knew he would come.

35
00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.060
But we didn't want to spoil the surprise.

36
00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:02.810
Come here, I really want to hug you.
